1
00:00:49,758 --> 00:00:50,717
<font color="white">"Truth be told,</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,469
<font color="white">I was ashamed."</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,182
<font color="white">"Each time your fervent touch</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:58,266 --> 00:01:00,060
<font color="white">fell upon my body,</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:01,728 --> 00:01:04,314
<font color="white">heat seemed to rise in every part of me,</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,816
<font color="white">and my body would writhe with it."</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:09,444
<font color="white">"And for that,</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:10,987 --> 00:01:12,489
<font color="white">I was deeply ashamed of myself."</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:14,908 --> 00:01:16,534
<font color="white">"I was in pain as well."</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:20,622
<font color="white">"When you filled me completely…</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:22,957 --> 00:01:26,419
<font color="white">the pain of flesh being parted</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">left me nearly senseless."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

12
00:01:28,797 --> 00:01:29,839
<font color="white">"Yet…"</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:35,929
<font color="white">"The moment I felt you moving inside me,</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:37,722 --> 00:01:39,265
<font color="white">I finally realized."</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:47,690
<font color="white">"I wish to spend all the countless nights</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ahead of me with you,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

16
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,027
<font color="white">and live so for the rest of my life."</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:56,616 --> 00:01:57,450
<font color="white">"Please</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:01:58,451 --> 00:02:00,620
<font color="white">stay by my side, just as you do now."</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:16,553
<font color="white">What a pitiful woman indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:19,889 --> 00:02:22,100
<font color="white">And all the more amusing for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:24,561 --> 00:02:28,022
<font color="white">So then, how was it for you?</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:32,402
<font color="white">Did the sight of that swooning widow</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:34,195 --> 00:02:35,405
<font color="white">stir your blood?</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:36,948 --> 00:02:39,200
<font color="white">When that woman, knowing nothing of men…</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:43,121 --> 00:02:44,664
<font color="white">clung to my neck</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:02:46,541 --> 00:02:48,001
<font color="white">and looked at me with pleading eyes…</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:02:55,425 --> 00:02:56,759
<font color="white">I found it all so warm.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:02:58,344 --> 00:02:59,721
<font color="white">Did you now?</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:04,767 --> 00:03:06,352
<font color="white">Are you displeased?</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:08,229
<font color="white">And if I am?</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:11,691
<font color="white">Surely you know.</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:14,152
<font color="white">The only reason I have gone this far…</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:16,237 --> 00:03:17,989
<font color="white">is all because of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:21,743 --> 00:03:22,744
<font color="white">Now, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:26,372 --> 00:03:27,790
<font color="white">Is tonight the night?</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:34,422
<font color="white">It is what I have long awaited.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:13,253 --> 00:04:14,754
<font color="white">I'm afraid</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:14,837 --> 00:04:16,714
<font color="white">I will have to postpone</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:19,384
<font color="white">your reward a little longer.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:20,677 --> 00:04:23,596
<font color="white">I was in the midst of something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">far more important.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

41
00:04:41,322 --> 00:04:43,950
<font color="white">A WOMAN THREW HERSELF FROM THE CLIFF</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:44,534 --> 00:04:46,953
<font color="white">IDENTIFIED AS LADY AN</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:47,787 --> 00:04:48,913
<font color="white">Wait, what…</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:48,997 --> 00:04:51,791
<font color="white">YOUR SERVANT, CHO WON,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">HUMBLY REPORTS TO YOUR MAJESTY</font><font color="white"></font></font>

45
00:04:51,874 --> 00:04:53,126
<font color="white">What is this?</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:53,209 --> 00:04:56,963
<font color="white">I hear you have been ordered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to recover the widow's body.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

47
00:04:57,046 --> 00:05:00,341
<font color="white">Since you have been occupied</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with this wretched wager of ours,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

48
00:05:00,425 --> 00:05:02,427
<font color="white">I thought I'd write it for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:03,928 --> 00:05:08,266
<font color="white">Though I never imagined</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">her desire to live had grown so strong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

50
00:05:10,768 --> 00:05:13,896
<font color="white">It seems she has gone back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on our agreement.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

51
00:05:14,522 --> 00:05:15,565
<font color="white">Agreement?</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:17,275 --> 00:05:19,068
<font color="white">When I wrote</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that marriage proposal for her,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

53
00:05:19,777 --> 00:05:21,612
<font color="white">she made me a promise.</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:24,532 --> 00:05:27,076
<font color="white">That she would accept death</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when the time came,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

55
00:05:27,952 --> 00:05:30,413
<font color="white">to fulfill her final duty</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the very least.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

56
00:05:32,415 --> 00:05:34,042
<font color="white">It is only proper, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:35,335 --> 00:05:38,880
<font color="white">That is how her story ought to end.</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:43,926
<font color="white">It is unfortunate that she still lives,</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:44,469 --> 00:05:46,179
<font color="white">but it matters not.</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:47,805 --> 00:05:48,765
<font color="white">In the end,</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:50,475 --> 00:05:51,976
<font color="white">she shall meet that fate.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:53,895 --> 00:05:56,105
<font color="white">All you need to do</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is take what I have written</font><font color="white"></font></font>

63
00:05:56,606 --> 00:05:58,649
<font color="white">and present it to His Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:59,692 --> 00:06:01,152
<font color="white">Tell him</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:03,488
<font color="white">that someone</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:04,447 --> 00:06:06,449
<font color="white">claims to have witnessed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the dreadful sight</font><font color="white"></font></font>

67
00:06:07,075 --> 00:06:09,035
<font color="white">of a woman casting herself from a cliff.</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:09,118 --> 00:06:12,872
<font color="white">So you would have me report a lie?</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:12,955 --> 00:06:16,167
<font color="white">Once the news reaches the widow,</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:17,418 --> 00:06:19,128
<font color="white">there will be nothing she can do.</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:20,088 --> 00:06:21,339
<font color="white">She will accept her fate</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:22,298 --> 00:06:23,633
<font color="white">and take her own life.</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:24,217 --> 00:06:28,137
<font color="white">Then everything may return</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to its proper place.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

74
00:06:29,764 --> 00:06:32,475
<font color="white">Your concern for me may be</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as vast as the heavens,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:35,645
<font color="white">but your kindness</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:36,479 --> 00:06:38,314
<font color="white">has gone too far, Cousin!</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:39,649 --> 00:06:40,691
<font color="white">This?</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:42,068 --> 00:06:44,904
<font color="white">This is not something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you should meddle in.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

79
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,322
<font color="white">Meddle?</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:48,116 --> 00:06:49,033
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:50,827 --> 00:06:52,703
<font color="white">Do you remember the day…</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:58,126
<font color="white">you became the pride of the family</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with the verse I wrote for you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

83
00:07:00,378 --> 00:07:03,256
<font color="white">I am only trying to help you now,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as I did then.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

84
00:07:06,926 --> 00:07:08,970
<font color="white">I remember it all too clearly.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:09,762 --> 00:07:12,890
<font color="white">How could I ever forget</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">those piercing eyes fixed upon me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

86
00:07:15,476 --> 00:07:17,061
<font color="white">If I could…</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:20,898 --> 00:07:22,984
<font color="white">If I could return to that day,</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:23,067 --> 00:07:25,236
<font color="white">I would tell them the verse</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:27,488
<font color="white">was never mine to begin with, but yours.</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:30,491
<font color="white">I am not…</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:38,207
<font color="white">I am not that boy anymore.</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:46,382 --> 00:07:48,426
<font color="white">-Won.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Do not call me that.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

93
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:50,470
<font color="white">You say you wrote this</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:50,553 --> 00:07:52,388
<font color="white">to help me, just as you did then?</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:54,807 --> 00:07:55,892
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:56,809 --> 00:07:57,727
<font color="white">Fine!</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:59,437 --> 00:08:01,606
<font color="white">Then let me ask you once more,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as I did back then.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

98
00:08:03,232 --> 00:08:04,901
<font color="white">Will you take my hand…</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:08,946 --> 00:08:10,740
<font color="white">and come with me this time?</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:41,938 --> 00:08:42,897
<font color="white">At last…</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:48,361
<font color="white">those are the words I have longed to hear.</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:52,823 --> 00:08:54,325
<font color="white">I have been waiting.</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:56,118 --> 00:08:58,162
<font color="white">For you to ask me to leave with you again.</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:01,624 --> 00:09:04,085
<font color="white">Ever since the day</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I failed to come to you,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

105
00:09:04,961 --> 00:09:06,587
<font color="white">it has never left my mind.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:09:08,422 --> 00:09:10,466
<font color="white">I wondered</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">where the boat I sent away in tears</font><font color="white"></font></font>

107
00:09:11,592 --> 00:09:13,511
<font color="white">had drifted by now…</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:16,472 --> 00:09:19,475
<font color="white">and whether I might ever find it again.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:23,312 --> 00:09:25,064
<font color="white">So tell me more.</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:26,816 --> 00:09:29,151
<font color="white">Tell me of the future you imagined for us.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:32,113 --> 00:09:34,156
<font color="white">Let me hear it now, if it is not too late.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:40,663
<font color="white">How about Yanjing, the city said to hold</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:43,374
<font color="white">all the world's wonders?</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:45,126 --> 00:09:46,002
<font color="white">Well?</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:21,203 --> 00:10:22,330
<font color="white">Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:10:29,545 --> 00:10:31,130
<font color="white">Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:41,307
<font color="white">I wanted to call you by your name.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:51,984 --> 00:10:52,943
<font color="white">Hui-yeon.</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:10:58,074 --> 00:10:59,075
<font color="white">Hui-yeon.</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:10,211 --> 00:11:15,925
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:11:47,915 --> 00:11:48,749
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:55,631
<font color="white">Young Master In-ho came by.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:11:58,467 --> 00:12:02,138
<font color="white">He saw me again</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">outside the gate just moments ago.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:12:13,023 --> 00:12:15,734
<font color="white">My lord, I do not care where we go.</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:20,865
<font color="white">Would you leave with me?</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:12:23,242 --> 00:12:24,618
<font color="white">Please come away with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:37,006
<font color="white">It is all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:40,509
<font color="white">Hearing you say that,</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:40,593 --> 00:12:42,052
<font color="white">I find myself</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:43,512 --> 00:12:44,972
<font color="white">foolishly happy.</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:49,393 --> 00:12:50,728
<font color="white">All right, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:51,729 --> 00:12:52,897
<font color="white">Where shall we go?</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:54,565 --> 00:12:55,566
<font color="white">Across the sea…</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:55,649 --> 00:12:56,484
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:58,194 --> 00:13:01,780
<font color="white">Perhaps, all the way to Yanjing,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">where no one will ever find us…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

136
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:14,919
<font color="white"><i>I have been waiting.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:13:15,753 --> 00:13:17,421
<font color="white"><i>For you to ask me to leave with you again.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:19,173
<font color="white">I do not care where.</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:13:20,132 --> 00:13:22,134
<font color="white"><i>How about Yanjing, the city said to hold</i></font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:13:23,552 --> 00:13:25,262
<font color="white"><i>all the world's wonders?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:13:27,014 --> 00:13:27,848
<font color="white"><i>Well?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:13:39,068 --> 00:13:40,277
<font color="white">I have been waiting.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:13:46,909 --> 00:13:48,577
<font color="white">I have been waiting to hear those words.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:54,083 --> 00:13:55,626
<font color="white">Tell me more.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:57,586 --> 00:13:58,420
<font color="white">Tell me</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:14:00,339 --> 00:14:01,298
<font color="white">of our future.</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:14:31,328 --> 00:14:33,038
<font color="white">There is something you must know.</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:14:33,789 --> 00:14:35,583
<font color="white">His Majesty has given me a command.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:14:36,125 --> 00:14:38,669
<font color="white">He said the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law passed away…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

150
00:14:41,005 --> 00:14:43,507
<font color="white">and I am to recover her body.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:14:46,302 --> 00:14:47,469
<font color="white">I will</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:14:49,305 --> 00:14:51,140
<font color="white">find a way somehow.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:14:52,683 --> 00:14:54,226
<font color="white">So you should leave first.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:14:55,561 --> 00:14:57,021
<font color="white">No, I will not.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:14:57,521 --> 00:14:59,398
<font color="white">Did you not say you wished to live?</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:16,373
<font color="white">I do wish to live.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,046
<font color="white">I wish to live with you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:29,845
<font color="white">That cannot be.</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:55,537
<font color="white">Truth be told, I have come to ask a favor.</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:15:56,288 --> 00:15:58,874
<font color="white">I was hoping</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you might have work for someone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

161
00:15:58,958 --> 00:16:00,209
<font color="white">For whom?</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:16:00,292 --> 00:16:02,419
<font color="white">-A woman.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-A woman?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

163
00:16:02,503 --> 00:16:04,088
<font color="white">A woman dressed as a man.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:16:13,138 --> 00:16:14,306
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:16,517
<font color="white">Do get up.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I have brought you some porridge--</font><font color="white"></font></font>

166
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,185
<font color="white">My head aches terribly.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:16:19,478 --> 00:16:20,688
<font color="white">Your head?</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:16:20,771 --> 00:16:22,398
<font color="white">Oh, In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:26,777
<font color="white">What has come over you?</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:16:37,663 --> 00:16:39,415
<font color="white">I said I would not eat,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so why do you keep…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

171
00:16:57,933 --> 00:17:00,019
<font color="white">I never knew</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you were capable of such impropriety.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

172
00:17:01,395 --> 00:17:03,480
<font color="white">I wish I had known sooner.</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:17:10,612 --> 00:17:13,032
<font color="white">You are hardly in a position to laugh.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:17:17,619 --> 00:17:19,913
<font color="white">The girl who is to become</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my brother-in-law's concubine…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

175
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:24,918
<font color="white">asked me to deliver this.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:17:30,382 --> 00:17:32,217
<font color="white">I never knew either.</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:17:32,301 --> 00:17:34,970
<font color="white">That you had such a lust for women.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:17:35,763 --> 00:17:37,181
<font color="white">Had I known sooner…</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:17:39,475 --> 00:17:42,561
<font color="white">I would have given my cousin fair warning.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:48,192
<font color="white">I wonder</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what your father would make of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

181
00:17:58,077 --> 00:17:58,952
<font color="white">What…</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:18:04,958 --> 00:18:05,793
<font color="white">Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:18:05,876 --> 00:18:07,044
<font color="white">Come now, young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:18:08,462 --> 00:18:10,839
<font color="white">There's no need for this between us.</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:18:16,095 --> 00:18:17,471
<font color="white">You need not worry.</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:18:17,554 --> 00:18:19,848
<font color="white">I shall not tell a soul.</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:23,685
<font color="white">It is the duty of a gentleman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to protect his family's honor, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:18:25,312 --> 00:18:26,522
<font color="white">But you see,</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:31,110
<font color="white">some things, once brought to light,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cannot be contained.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

190
00:19:53,442 --> 00:19:55,360
<font color="white">You said you were</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:56,445 --> 00:19:57,821
<font color="white">no longer that boy.</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:20:00,741 --> 00:20:02,451
<font color="white">And yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:06,330
<font color="white">when you asked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to leave with you once more,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

194
00:20:08,248 --> 00:20:09,249
<font color="white">I felt as though</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:13,003
<font color="white">I had met that sweet young man</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from my youth again.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

196
00:20:15,047 --> 00:20:17,007
<font color="white">It made my whole body tremble.</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:20:28,435 --> 00:20:31,647
<font color="white">So then, did you go to Hwaseong?</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:35,525
<font color="white">You went to see things through</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with the widow, I trust?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

199
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:37,444
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:20:41,114 --> 00:20:44,409
<font color="white">If you were only going to return</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to your rightful place in the end,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

201
00:20:45,994 --> 00:20:48,914
<font color="white">there was no need</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for that foolish wager at all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

202
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:54,211
<font color="white">So, what became of the widow?</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:20:54,878 --> 00:20:56,964
<font color="white">Did she part from you easily enough?</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:21:02,636 --> 00:21:05,639
<font color="white">She seemed to have</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">neither attachment nor strength left.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

205
00:21:09,226 --> 00:21:10,936
<font color="white">She will take her own life.</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:21:15,148 --> 00:21:16,108
<font color="white">Soon, I imagine.</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:21:19,778 --> 00:21:20,821
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:21:23,448 --> 00:21:25,951
<font color="white">Perhaps we should count that as a mercy.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:29,788
<font color="white">But there is a problem.</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:34,334
<font color="white">I do not know how,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but the Left State Councilor's son…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

211
00:21:36,795 --> 00:21:38,505
<font color="white">seemed to know everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:21:39,131 --> 00:21:41,049
<font color="white">Young Master In-ho should be fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:21:42,217 --> 00:21:43,927
<font color="white">He is too soft-hearted</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:21:44,428 --> 00:21:46,346
<font color="white">to let it slip.</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,683
<font color="white">The real problem is</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:21:51,393 --> 00:21:53,270
<font color="white">the Lady of the First Rank.</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:21:54,813 --> 00:21:55,814
<font color="white">She knows.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:21:57,316 --> 00:21:59,151
<font color="white">I should have told you this first,</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:21:59,651 --> 00:22:02,738
<font color="white">but I feared it would</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">only cause you needless worry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

220
00:22:03,322 --> 00:22:07,409
<font color="white">As long as she can secure</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a Memorial Gate for her daughter-in-law,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

221
00:22:07,909 --> 00:22:10,037
<font color="white">she will turn a blind eye</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to everything else.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

222
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:12,539
<font color="white">She said she must be granted one.</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:14,958
<font color="white">That was her only request.</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:22:15,584 --> 00:22:17,252
<font color="white">Did she threaten you?</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:22:20,756 --> 00:22:23,633
<font color="white">She asked a favor of me.</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:22:23,717 --> 00:22:25,635
<font color="white">-Cousin.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Please tell His Majesty</font><font color="white"></font></font>

227
00:22:26,386 --> 00:22:29,139
<font color="white">exactly what I wrote for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:22:29,222 --> 00:22:30,932
<font color="white">That is all you need to do.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:34,144
<font color="white">Then no one and nothing</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:22:34,227 --> 00:22:37,230
<font color="white">will trouble you and me ever again.</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:22:42,527 --> 00:22:43,361
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:22:54,748 --> 00:22:57,542
<font color="white">I was keeping this</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to show you when you came.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

233
00:22:58,710 --> 00:22:59,586
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,923
<font color="white">This is you, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:23:04,508 --> 00:23:07,761
<font color="white">THERE WAS A MAN WHO WENT ABOUT</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">SCOLDING WOMEN'S SECRET PLACES…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

236
00:23:16,228 --> 00:23:17,312
<font color="white">Where…</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:23:19,147 --> 00:23:20,315
<font color="white">did you get this?</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:23:20,398 --> 00:23:22,984
<font color="white">Eun-sil's mistress ordered it burned,</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:23:23,068 --> 00:23:25,570
<font color="white">but the women working there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">were passing it around in secret.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

240
00:23:26,196 --> 00:23:28,824
<font color="white">My dear Eun-sil</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">thought you ought to see it,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

241
00:23:28,907 --> 00:23:32,077
<font color="white">so she traded her precious jerky for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:23:34,162 --> 00:23:35,163
<font color="white">Oh, Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:23:35,247 --> 00:23:36,081
<font color="white">"Oh, Bun-hui"?</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:23:37,249 --> 00:23:38,583
<font color="white">-Bun-hui…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Bun-hui?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

245
00:23:48,009 --> 00:23:50,011
<font color="white">Run an errand for me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Go to Mapo Ferry Crossing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

246
00:23:51,763 --> 00:23:52,889
<font color="white">We are leaving for Yanjing.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:23:53,515 --> 00:23:54,432
<font color="white">Yanjing?</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:23:54,516 --> 00:23:55,684
<font color="white">The Great State?</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:23:56,476 --> 00:23:57,727
<font color="white">Whether by sea or by land,</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:23:59,062 --> 00:24:01,148
<font color="white">find the fastest route</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that will not draw attention.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

251
00:24:01,731 --> 00:24:02,649
<font color="white">And…</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:24:05,652 --> 00:24:07,946
<font color="white">it must be suitable for a woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to make the journey.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

253
00:24:08,530 --> 00:24:10,824
<font color="white">A woman? Who have you gone and found now?</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:24:10,907 --> 00:24:11,783
<font color="white">What about Eun-sil?</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:24:13,118 --> 00:24:14,619
<font color="white">You'd leave her behind?</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:24:15,829 --> 00:24:17,205
<font color="white">Eun-sil…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:24:17,289 --> 00:24:19,749
<font color="white">Eun-sil is going to Yanjing too?</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:20,750
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:24:21,418 --> 00:24:22,669
<font color="white">I have somewhere to go.</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:24:23,378 --> 00:24:25,463
<font color="white">-Make sure you find out all you can.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

261
00:24:36,474 --> 00:24:37,434
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:41,771
<font color="white">Are you heading out somewhere?</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:24:52,490 --> 00:24:54,743
<font color="white">Should I not be making preparations</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for our departure?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

264
00:24:57,746 --> 00:25:01,374
<font color="white">Then when do you intend</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to see His Majesty?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

265
00:25:05,462 --> 00:25:06,504
<font color="white">I shall make haste.</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:25:11,593 --> 00:25:15,472
<font color="white">If you tie it so loosely,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it will come undone at once.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

267
00:25:20,435 --> 00:25:22,062
<font color="white">It must be tied firmly.</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:25:25,482 --> 00:25:26,524
<font color="white">There.</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:25:27,692 --> 00:25:28,652
<font color="white">Off you go now.</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:25:35,116 --> 00:25:35,951
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:26:12,654 --> 00:26:13,655
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:26:16,283 --> 00:26:17,117
<font color="white">What is the matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,207
<font color="white">I stepped out for a short while.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:26:24,291 --> 00:26:26,209
<font color="white">By the time I returned,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she had already left.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

275
00:26:27,627 --> 00:26:29,129
<font color="white">Forgive me, young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:26:29,212 --> 00:26:30,422
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:26:31,464 --> 00:26:32,757
<font color="white">The fault is mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:26:36,136 --> 00:26:37,137
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:26:44,519 --> 00:26:47,188
<font color="white">So, when is your mother expected back?</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:26:47,272 --> 00:26:48,523
<font color="white">To tell the truth,</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:26:49,232 --> 00:26:51,901
<font color="white">I do not believe</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she can see you today, madam.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:26:53,737 --> 00:26:57,073
<font color="white">She went to Mapo Ferry Crossing to receive</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a shipment of tobacco from Qing,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

283
00:26:57,157 --> 00:26:59,451
<font color="white">and she insists on</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">inspecting everything herself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

284
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:03,163
<font color="white">I expect she will not be back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">until near sundown.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

285
00:27:04,539 --> 00:27:05,665
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:27:05,749 --> 00:27:06,875
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:11,421
<font color="white">There is a matter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I entrusted to your mother,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:27:11,504 --> 00:27:14,758
<font color="white">yet I have heard nothing of it,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">which is why I came myself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

289
00:27:16,968 --> 00:27:19,346
<font color="white">Perhaps if I had spoken more kindly,</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:27:20,263 --> 00:27:23,058
<font color="white">she might have understood me better</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and been quicker about it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

291
00:27:23,767 --> 00:27:27,187
<font color="white">I do not care to repeat myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:27:30,315 --> 00:27:32,150
<font color="white">So I shall not say it a third time.</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:27:32,734 --> 00:27:34,277
<font color="white">I shall grant you a fortnight's grace.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:27:34,903 --> 00:27:36,279
<font color="white">Collect every last one of them.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:27:39,657 --> 00:27:42,410
<font color="white">My reputation and standing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">were not built overnight,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

296
00:27:42,994 --> 00:27:45,914
<font color="white">and I cannot afford</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to let this stain spread any further.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

297
00:27:50,627 --> 00:27:51,836
<font color="white">Do pass that along to her.</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:27:54,881 --> 00:27:55,924
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:28:01,137 --> 00:28:03,390
<font color="white">Who does she think she is?</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:28:04,015 --> 00:28:07,519
<font color="white">Once So-ok is with child,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she will be shoved into a back room!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

301
00:28:07,602 --> 00:28:09,020
<font color="white">Unbelievable.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:28:09,771 --> 00:28:11,022
<font color="white">How dare she?</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:28:11,731 --> 00:28:13,608
<font color="white">Mother, are you all right?</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:28:13,691 --> 00:28:17,195
<font color="white">Do I look all right?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm fit to burst with rage!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

305
00:28:17,278 --> 00:28:18,405
<font color="white">But Mother,</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:28:19,197 --> 00:28:22,242
<font color="white">you are at your most beautiful</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you are angry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

307
00:28:27,622 --> 00:28:28,581
<font color="white">For heaven's sake!</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:28:29,541 --> 00:28:31,418
<font color="white">You blithering idiot.</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:28:32,043 --> 00:28:33,336
<font color="white">Good grief.</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:28:34,712 --> 00:28:37,257
<font color="white">I'm furious. So furious!</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,183
<font color="white">Excuse me!</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:28:47,267 --> 00:28:48,727
<font color="white">This is a forgery, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:28:50,103 --> 00:28:52,939
<font color="white">Who cares whether a dirty picture</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is genuine or forged?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:28:53,022 --> 00:28:55,108
<font color="white">As long as it's titillating.</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:28:55,191 --> 00:28:57,694
<font color="white">This painting you've been collecting?</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:28:58,778 --> 00:29:02,532
<font color="white">The entire city of Hanyang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is flooded with exact copies of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

317
00:29:03,116 --> 00:29:04,367
<font color="white">Not just one or two.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:29:04,451 --> 00:29:05,577
<font color="white">At least dozens…</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:29:06,161 --> 00:29:08,580
<font color="white">No, there may well be hundreds by now.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:29:09,289 --> 00:29:11,040
<font color="white">It may take you some time.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:29:19,132 --> 00:29:22,177
<font color="white">Before His Lordship returns,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have the servants…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

322
00:29:28,433 --> 00:29:29,267
<font color="white">Madam?</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:29:33,813 --> 00:29:34,647
<font color="white">Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:29:35,732 --> 00:29:36,649
<font color="white">Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:29:37,358 --> 00:29:39,903
<font color="white">Send So-ok and the servants</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">out of the house,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

326
00:29:40,528 --> 00:29:41,696
<font color="white">then bar the front gate.</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:29:43,364 --> 00:29:45,366
<font color="white">Yes, I will.</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:52,957
<font color="white">Come along, all of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:29:55,502 --> 00:29:57,170
<font color="white">Has my cousin not returned yet?</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:29:57,253 --> 00:29:58,880
<font color="white">No, he has not.</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:29:58,963 --> 00:30:00,548
<font color="white">Tell me the moment he does.</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:30:00,632 --> 00:30:01,508
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:30:02,509 --> 00:30:03,468
<font color="white">Hurry.</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:30:32,121 --> 00:30:34,207
<font color="white">I must say, this is rather bold of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:30:35,917 --> 00:30:38,336
<font color="white">For someone who claimed to know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she must depart with honor,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

336
00:30:39,379 --> 00:30:41,631
<font color="white">what possessed you to come here?</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:30:42,757 --> 00:30:44,008
<font color="white">I am deeply ashamed.</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:30:52,767 --> 00:30:54,227
<font color="white">Go on, then. Explain yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:30:55,562 --> 00:30:59,190
<font color="white">What brings you to me in such a state?</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:07,490
<font color="white">Please persuade Lord Cho.</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:31:07,991 --> 00:31:09,492
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:31:12,245 --> 00:31:13,246
<font color="white">He said</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:18,960
<font color="white">he had been ordered to recover my body.</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:31:22,797 --> 00:31:24,340
<font color="white">He said he would find a way</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:31:25,884 --> 00:31:27,927
<font color="white">and urged me to flee first.</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:31:34,142 --> 00:31:35,143
<font color="white">He</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:31:36,477 --> 00:31:37,729
<font color="white">said that?</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:31:39,647 --> 00:31:41,900
<font color="white">He told me to go somewhere</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:31:43,234 --> 00:31:45,403
<font color="white">no one would ever find us.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:31:50,992 --> 00:31:52,577
<font color="white">But if he reports</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:31:53,328 --> 00:31:56,289
<font color="white">a falsehood because of me,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">his life will be at risk.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

352
00:31:59,292 --> 00:32:01,920
<font color="white">I cannot leave him behind</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and flee on my own.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

353
00:32:09,052 --> 00:32:11,721
<font color="white">If you are so worried for his life…</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:32:14,057 --> 00:32:16,893
<font color="white">then why not make the lie the truth?</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:32:28,821 --> 00:32:29,781
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:32:29,864 --> 00:32:31,032
<font color="white">Has something happened?</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:32:32,033 --> 00:32:32,867
<font color="white">What is the matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:32:34,786 --> 00:32:36,579
<font color="white">Now that you have come to know love,</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:32:37,372 --> 00:32:39,040
<font color="white">are you afraid to die?</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:32:40,541 --> 00:32:44,253
<font color="white">Do you no longer care</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the chastity and family honor</font><font color="white"></font></font>

361
00:32:45,588 --> 00:32:47,465
<font color="white">you were so determined to protect?</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:32:50,635 --> 00:32:51,678
<font color="white">Lady An.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:32:52,512 --> 00:32:56,099
<font color="white">If your love is strong enough</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to save a man who ought to die,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

364
00:32:57,517 --> 00:33:00,186
<font color="white">why can you not act yourself?</font><font color="white"></font>

365
00:33:01,062 --> 00:33:03,064
<font color="white">Why come to me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">instead of doing it yourself?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

366
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:05,858
<font color="white">I cannot understand it.</font><font color="white"></font>

367
00:33:10,363 --> 00:33:11,948
<font color="white">It is cowardly of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:33:18,413 --> 00:33:19,414
<font color="white">I know.</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:33:24,377 --> 00:33:26,629
<font color="white">But this was the only place</font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:33:27,422 --> 00:33:28,881
<font color="white">I could think to come.</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:33:30,675 --> 00:33:31,801
<font color="white">Did you not…</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:33:34,512 --> 00:33:36,139
<font color="white">confide your secret to me</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:33:36,681 --> 00:33:38,766
<font color="white">and offer me your friendship?</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:33:38,850 --> 00:33:40,476
<font color="white">Did you just</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:33:41,394 --> 00:33:42,812
<font color="white">invoke my secret?</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:33:44,731 --> 00:33:46,232
<font color="white">I beg of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:50,028
<font color="white">Just persuade him.</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:33:50,903 --> 00:33:52,572
<font color="white">Tell him he must not go to His Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:33:54,449 --> 00:33:55,366
<font color="white">Madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:33:56,117 --> 00:33:57,577
<font color="white">Madam! Lord Cho Won has…</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:22,393
<font color="white">Why are you here?</font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:34:23,519 --> 00:34:25,229
<font color="white">I came to ask for help.</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:29,609
<font color="white">I cannot leave you behind.</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:34:39,827 --> 00:34:41,120
<font color="white">I beg you, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:34:41,621 --> 00:34:45,374
<font color="white">Please tell him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he must not go to His Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

386
00:34:45,458 --> 00:34:47,168
<font color="white">Tell him to leave with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:34:59,138 --> 00:35:02,809
<font color="white">Since you are so desperate,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I have no choice but to oblige.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

388
00:35:12,652 --> 00:35:14,278
<font color="white">I shall help</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:35:15,279 --> 00:35:16,697
<font color="white">the two of you leave.</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:35:17,824 --> 00:35:20,034
<font color="white">I am not without compassion.</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:35:21,994 --> 00:35:22,829
<font color="white">But first…</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:35:25,581 --> 00:35:28,292
<font color="white">I would like to hear it from you, Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:35:29,210 --> 00:35:31,170
<font color="white">What is it that you want?</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:35:33,548 --> 00:35:34,715
<font color="white">Do you</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:35:35,424 --> 00:35:37,552
<font color="white">truly wish to leave with her?</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:35:50,106 --> 00:35:52,358
<font color="white">Tell her you will leave with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:35:56,154 --> 00:35:56,988
<font color="white">Could I…</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:36:03,870 --> 00:36:05,621
<font color="white">Could I ever leave?</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:36:06,914 --> 00:36:07,832
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:36:11,752 --> 00:36:13,296
<font color="white">I tried to break free…</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:36:16,632 --> 00:36:19,260
<font color="white">yet the heart I left behind</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">only grows clearer.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

402
00:36:21,554 --> 00:36:24,307
<font color="white">I felt the same after you left.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:36:26,350 --> 00:36:27,643
<font color="white">That is what it means to love.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:36:33,566 --> 00:36:34,525
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:39,113
<font color="white">There is someone I love.</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:37:16,359 --> 00:37:17,193
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:37:20,279 --> 00:37:22,865
<font color="white">Can you not simply come with me?</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:37:26,327 --> 00:37:28,579
<font color="white">Do you not love me?</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:38:05,241 --> 00:38:07,076
<font color="white">What will you do now?</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:38:08,577 --> 00:38:11,080
<font color="white">Will you make the lie the truth</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:38:11,163 --> 00:38:13,416
<font color="white">to save him from danger?</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:38:14,250 --> 00:38:15,584
<font color="white">Or will you leave this place</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:38:16,294 --> 00:38:18,587
<font color="white">and live quietly as though you were dead?</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:38:19,547 --> 00:38:21,257
<font color="white">If you wish,</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:38:21,340 --> 00:38:24,135
<font color="white">I shall find a way</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for you to live on your own.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

416
00:38:26,178 --> 00:38:27,305
<font color="white">Choose.</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:38:35,313 --> 00:38:36,480
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:39:33,662 --> 00:39:34,580
<font color="white">Do you</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:39:36,540 --> 00:39:37,917
<font color="white">love her?</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:39:40,336 --> 00:39:41,420
<font color="white">Love?</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:39:44,507 --> 00:39:49,178
<font color="white">When she begged me to leave with her…</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:39:55,226 --> 00:39:57,144
<font color="white">I truly meant to go.</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:39:58,646 --> 00:39:59,688
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:39:59,772 --> 00:40:02,733
<font color="white">It pained me because I saw myself in her,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">clinging to you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

425
00:40:04,568 --> 00:40:05,736
<font color="white">But in that moment,</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:40:06,529 --> 00:40:08,614
<font color="white">I realized something with perfect clarity.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:40:11,283 --> 00:40:12,284
<font color="white">That you</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:40:14,286 --> 00:40:16,622
<font color="white">never intended to leave with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:40:20,084 --> 00:40:22,044
<font color="white">Because I could not leave with her,</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:25,214
<font color="white">I spoke of nothing but impossible dreams.</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:40:27,925 --> 00:40:30,344
<font color="white">"Shall we cross the sea or go to Yanjing?"</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:40:32,888 --> 00:40:34,849
<font color="white">Once I stood in your place, I understood.</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:40:38,185 --> 00:40:41,063
<font color="white">You never intended to leave with me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the beginning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

434
00:40:49,697 --> 00:40:51,031
<font color="white">I was terrified…</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:40:58,038 --> 00:40:59,540
<font color="white">of being abandoned.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:41:01,584 --> 00:41:02,668
<font color="white">And you think I love her?</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:41:20,394 --> 00:41:21,979
<font color="white">You know as well as I do…</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:41:24,273 --> 00:41:26,442
<font color="white">that our bond</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:41:26,525 --> 00:41:28,152
<font color="white">can never be severed.</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:30,404
<font color="white">As we agreed,</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:41:31,530 --> 00:41:33,407
<font color="white">tell His Majesty about the widow…</font><font color="white"></font>

442
00:41:35,493 --> 00:41:36,410
<font color="white">and please…</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:41:38,037 --> 00:41:40,164
<font color="white">Please come back to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:41:48,130 --> 00:41:51,509
<font color="white">I want to know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the look on His Majesty's face</font><font color="white"></font></font>

445
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:54,929
<font color="white">when he reads what I wrote,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every word he says.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

446
00:41:55,930 --> 00:41:57,014
<font color="white">I want to hear</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:41:57,973 --> 00:41:59,058
<font color="white">everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:42:03,562 --> 00:42:04,396
<font color="white">Please?</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:42:06,315 --> 00:42:08,067
<font color="white">You will do that for me, won't you?</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:42:30,464 --> 00:42:32,049
<font color="white">If that is what you wish…</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:42:38,305 --> 00:42:39,515
<font color="white">that is what I shall do.</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:43:50,085 --> 00:43:52,212
<font color="white">Why did you come to me…</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:43:55,841 --> 00:43:58,427
<font color="white">when your heart</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">already belonged to another?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

454
00:44:02,681 --> 00:44:04,933
<font color="white">I made a wager over your chastity.</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:44:07,853 --> 00:44:09,772
<font color="white">If I could claim your body and heart,</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:44:14,234 --> 00:44:17,655
<font color="white">I would have a chance to win</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the woman I had longed for all my life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

457
00:44:21,075 --> 00:44:24,370
<font color="white">I had no reason to refuse such a wager.</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:44:27,539 --> 00:44:29,041
<font color="white">Do you mean to say…</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:44:33,212 --> 00:44:35,381
<font color="white">you humiliated an innocent woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to win another?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

460
00:44:39,176 --> 00:44:40,594
<font color="white">That is the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:44:46,809 --> 00:44:48,060
<font color="white">How vile of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:44:55,567 --> 00:44:57,486
<font color="white">So? Did you win her?</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:44:59,655 --> 00:45:00,489
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:45:01,740 --> 00:45:02,616
<font color="white">Why not?</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:45:03,909 --> 00:45:05,702
<font color="white">After all you have put me through,</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:45:07,579 --> 00:45:09,498
<font color="white">you should have.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:45:28,767 --> 00:45:30,727
<font color="white">We are near</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Left State Councilor's residence.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

468
00:45:31,770 --> 00:45:33,188
<font color="white">I fear</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:45:34,356 --> 00:45:35,524
<font color="white">someone may recognize you.</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:45:55,878 --> 00:45:58,338
<font color="white">I will ask no further favor of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:46:00,424 --> 00:46:02,009
<font color="white">Please do not die.</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:46:03,051 --> 00:46:04,470
<font color="white">Live well.</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:46:08,557 --> 00:46:11,518
<font color="white">I resent you bitterly.</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:46:20,611 --> 00:46:22,404
<font color="white">And by that exact same measure…</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:46:34,082 --> 00:46:35,959
<font color="white">I shall live on.</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:48:51,219 --> 00:48:53,972
<font color="white">Cheong, come in.</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:48:57,059 --> 00:49:00,896
<font color="white">I wish to make myself beautiful.</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:49:34,638 --> 00:49:37,224
<font color="white">You are capable of writing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">something proper after all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

479
00:49:38,892 --> 00:49:41,478
<font color="white">So the body was never recovered.</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:49:42,688 --> 00:49:44,189
<font color="white">Yet as I read this,</font><font color="white"></font>

481
00:49:44,856 --> 00:49:47,818
<font color="white">I can see before me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a death so dignified, so heartbreaking.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

482
00:49:49,111 --> 00:49:52,280
<font color="white">Now, tell me more about the witness.</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:49:53,031 --> 00:49:54,658
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor should hear it.</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:50:01,957 --> 00:50:05,836
<font color="white">It was a papermaker who witnessed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the moment she took her life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

485
00:50:05,919 --> 00:50:08,088
<font color="white">He supplies paper</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the Hwaseong construction works.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

486
00:50:08,839 --> 00:50:10,799
<font color="white">By his account,</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:50:12,676 --> 00:50:14,845
<font color="white">it was at dawn,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after days of relentless rain,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

488
00:50:14,928 --> 00:50:17,347
<font color="white">when floodwaters</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">were rushing below the cliff.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

489
00:50:18,682 --> 00:50:21,810
<font color="white">As he drew water and looked up,</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:50:21,893 --> 00:50:25,397
<font color="white">he saw a noblewoman weeping bitterly.</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:27,107
<font color="white">But in the blink of an eye,</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:50:27,816 --> 00:50:29,234
<font color="white">the woman</font><font color="white"></font>

493
00:50:30,402 --> 00:50:32,028
<font color="white">had thrown herself from the cliff.</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:50:36,283 --> 00:50:40,245
<font color="white">Though the swollen river carried her away</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and she could not be found,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

495
00:50:41,037 --> 00:50:44,332
<font color="white">the date matches the day</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Councilor's daughter-in-law's brother</font><font color="white"></font></font>

496
00:50:44,416 --> 00:50:45,792
<font color="white">began searching for her body.</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:50:46,376 --> 00:50:47,252
<font color="white">As such,</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:50:50,172 --> 00:50:52,340
<font color="white">it could only have been her.</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:50:56,762 --> 00:50:57,804
<font color="white">Your Majesty,</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:50:57,888 --> 00:50:58,889
<font color="white">all of this</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:50:59,806 --> 00:51:02,476
<font color="white">is due to my own failing.</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:51:02,559 --> 00:51:05,312
<font color="white">I beg you, do not grant the Memorial Gate.</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:51:05,395 --> 00:51:06,480
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:51:07,272 --> 00:51:10,025
<font color="white">Who could hope to stop a raging storm?</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:51:11,443 --> 00:51:12,903
<font color="white">Hear me, Left State Councilor.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:51:12,986 --> 00:51:14,279
<font color="white">The Memorial Gate is granted.</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:51:15,405 --> 00:51:16,740
<font color="white">It is time you accepted it.</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:51:22,829 --> 00:51:25,665
<font color="white">Your grace knows no bounds, Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:51:26,208 --> 00:51:28,502
<font color="white">-Your grace knows no bounds.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Your grace knows no bounds.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

510
00:51:43,475 --> 00:51:45,769
<font color="white">I merely carried out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the command I was given.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

511
00:51:58,573 --> 00:51:59,741
<font color="white">Cho Won, stop there.</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:52:02,911 --> 00:52:03,745
<font color="white">Come with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:52:11,503 --> 00:52:13,505
<font color="white">I consider this construction</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:52:14,297 --> 00:52:17,342
<font color="white">the most important undertaking of my life.</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:52:17,425 --> 00:52:21,179
<font color="white">That is why,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">though I am confined to the palace,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

516
00:52:21,805 --> 00:52:24,349
<font color="white">I receive daily secret reports</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:52:25,141 --> 00:52:26,935
<font color="white">from dozens of officials besides you</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:52:27,018 --> 00:52:30,272
<font color="white">on the conditions throughout Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:52:31,189 --> 00:52:33,608
<font color="white">On the day before the widow</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cast herself from the cliff,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

520
00:52:35,402 --> 00:52:38,071
<font color="white">only a light drizzle fell in Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:52:42,742 --> 00:52:44,077
<font color="white">Now, tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:52:47,163 --> 00:52:50,500
<font color="white">Knowing full well that such a trifling lie</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">could never deceive me,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:52:51,668 --> 00:52:52,878
<font color="white">why did you tell it?</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:53:07,642 --> 00:53:09,311
<font color="white">Do you dare remain silent</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:53:09,895 --> 00:53:12,731
<font color="white">because there is something you'd protect</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even at the cost of your life?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

526
00:53:16,151 --> 00:53:18,028
<font color="white">You have not changed at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:53:18,945 --> 00:53:21,448
<font color="white">Always speaking without a thought</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the consequences.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

528
00:53:23,116 --> 00:53:24,117
<font color="white">And yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:53:24,784 --> 00:53:27,120
<font color="white">I always envied that about you.</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:53:28,371 --> 00:53:31,917
<font color="white">I have never been able to live as myself,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">not even for a moment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

531
00:53:33,668 --> 00:53:36,504
<font color="white">I've always had to live as someone's son,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">under the late king's shadow.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

532
00:53:37,714 --> 00:53:40,926
<font color="white">So I envied how freely</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you spread your wings and flew,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

533
00:53:41,760 --> 00:53:42,844
<font color="white">untethered.</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:53:46,765 --> 00:53:49,059
<font color="white">That is why</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I held you in such special regard.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

535
00:53:50,185 --> 00:53:51,853
<font color="white">I kept an unworthy man by my side,</font><font color="white"></font>

536
00:53:51,937 --> 00:53:53,897
<font color="white">sending him to do the things I could not,</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:53:54,856 --> 00:53:56,733
<font color="white">hoping he would become</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my most trusted man.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

538
00:53:57,776 --> 00:53:58,652
<font color="white">Your Majesty.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:54:02,238 --> 00:54:03,907
<font color="white">Forgive my boldness.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:54:06,451 --> 00:54:07,577
<font color="white">But in truth…</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:54:11,456 --> 00:54:13,375
<font color="white">I am but a bird trapped in a cage…</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:54:15,961 --> 00:54:17,796
<font color="white">one that has never flown.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:54:26,262 --> 00:54:28,098
<font color="white">Hear me, Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:54:30,475 --> 00:54:32,852
<font color="white">For the crime of daring</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to deceive your sovereign,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

545
00:54:32,936 --> 00:54:35,313
<font color="white">I shall end the friendship between us.</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:54:35,814 --> 00:54:36,773
<font color="white">Never again</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:54:37,816 --> 00:54:40,402
<font color="white">shall you stand before me like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:55:26,740 --> 00:55:32,412
<font color="white">CHO-HUI</font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:55:37,250 --> 00:55:40,003
<font color="white"><i>His Majesty</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>was deeply moved by your writing.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:55:41,504 --> 00:55:43,798
<font color="white"><i>The death it portrayed was so vivid that,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:55:43,882 --> 00:55:45,592
<font color="white"><i>more than the gravity</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>of the Memorial Gate,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:55:45,675 --> 00:55:48,053
<font color="white"><i>he seemed to feel the sorrow</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>of losing one of his people</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:55:48,136 --> 00:55:50,555
<font color="white"><i>and could not conceal his grief.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:55:51,765 --> 00:55:52,682
<font color="white"><i>As a result,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:55:53,475 --> 00:55:55,935
<font color="white"><i>a Memorial Gate will be erected</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>for the Councilor's family.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:55:56,019 --> 00:55:58,229
<font color="white">Thank you for bringing me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such a precious letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

557
00:55:58,813 --> 00:55:59,856
<font color="white">Of course, madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:56:00,899 --> 00:56:02,150
<font color="white">Gye-hwa, are you there?</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:56:02,233 --> 00:56:04,360
<font color="white">-Prepare drinks and refreshments.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, madam.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

560
00:56:04,444 --> 00:56:05,570
<font color="white">When my cousin arrives…</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:56:07,238 --> 00:56:08,156
<font color="white">Never mind.</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:56:08,698 --> 00:56:10,116
<font color="white">I shall go out and wait for him.</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:56:25,465 --> 00:56:26,758
<font color="white">You arrived right on time.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:56:26,841 --> 00:56:27,675
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:56:28,968 --> 00:56:30,095
<font color="white">Is it just you, sir?</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:56:30,178 --> 00:56:31,471
<font color="white">I came to take you across myself</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:56:31,554 --> 00:56:33,765
<font color="white">because I was told</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you'd be traveling with a woman.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

568
00:56:34,599 --> 00:56:35,767
<font color="white">Well, things changed.</font><font color="white"></font>

569
00:56:40,480 --> 00:56:43,316
<font color="white">I'll pay the full fare, so let us be off.</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:56:45,318 --> 00:56:46,861
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:56:53,493 --> 00:56:54,327
<font color="white">All right, then.</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:56:55,745 --> 00:56:57,163
<font color="white">Off we go!</font><font color="white"></font>

573
00:58:03,021 --> 00:58:05,064
<font color="white">What takes you to Yanjing?</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:58:05,648 --> 00:58:09,360
<font color="white">It does not seem like</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you are going there to pursue scholarship.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

575
00:58:13,490 --> 00:58:14,824
<font color="white">Sharp-eyed, are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:58:16,534 --> 00:58:20,413
<font color="white">You are not fleeing after committing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">some grave crime, are you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

577
00:58:21,122 --> 00:58:22,707
<font color="white">That would get me in trouble.</font><font color="white"></font>

578
00:58:26,085 --> 00:58:27,712
<font color="white">I spent my days chasing women…</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:58:30,048 --> 00:58:32,926
<font color="white">and now two of them are after me.</font><font color="white"></font>

580
00:58:34,010 --> 00:58:35,220
<font color="white">Quite the predicament.</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:58:37,847 --> 00:58:39,724
<font color="white">I am making a midnight escape.</font><font color="white"></font>

582
00:58:42,143 --> 00:58:43,937
<font color="white">Well, only two?</font><font color="white"></font>

583
00:58:45,021 --> 00:58:47,941
<font color="white">I'd be happy with three or four!</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:58:54,781 --> 00:58:57,825
<font color="white">If you say the word,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I shall turn the boat around.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

585
00:58:58,701 --> 00:59:01,871
<font color="white">You do not look much like a man</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who truly wishes to run away.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

586
00:59:03,164 --> 00:59:06,417
<font color="white">If we turn back now,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'll only charge half the fare.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

587
00:59:10,838 --> 00:59:12,882
<font color="white">Return to whom?</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:59:32,735 --> 00:59:33,820
<font color="white">My lord?</font><font color="white"></font>

589
00:59:34,737 --> 00:59:35,572
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

590
00:59:36,155 --> 00:59:37,156
<font color="white">Good heavens!</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:59:41,911 --> 00:59:42,870
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

592
00:59:47,375 --> 00:59:48,376
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

593
01:00:09,105 --> 01:00:10,273
<font color="white">Damn it!</font><font color="white"></font>

594
01:00:10,773 --> 01:00:12,984
<font color="white">Do you know how hard it is</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to be born a nobleman?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

595
01:00:13,901 --> 01:00:14,777
<font color="white">For heaven's sake!</font><font color="white"></font>

596
01:00:15,570 --> 01:00:16,779
<font color="white">Damn it!</font><font color="white"></font>

597
01:00:56,110 --> 01:00:58,613
<font color="white">Mister, I'm heading to Hanyang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with a delivery.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

598
01:00:59,155 --> 01:01:00,657
<font color="white">-Right.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I'll go with him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

599
01:01:00,740 --> 01:01:02,408
<font color="white">I packed some snacks for the road.</font><font color="white"></font>

600
01:01:02,492 --> 01:01:05,286
<font color="white">Keep your eyes open while you're there.</font><font color="white"></font>

601
01:01:05,370 --> 01:01:06,788
<font color="white">Who knows?</font><font color="white"></font>

602
01:01:06,871 --> 01:01:08,956
<font color="white">You might find Lord Cho Won somewhere.</font><font color="white"></font>

603
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:13,795
<font color="white">What would I even do</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with that heartless nobleman?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

604
01:01:13,878 --> 01:01:15,755
<font color="white">You fool.</font><font color="white"></font>

605
01:01:16,464 --> 01:01:18,716
<font color="white">Who do you think got you your freedom,</font><font color="white"></font>

606
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,093
<font color="white">paid for Eun-sil's as well,</font><font color="white"></font>

607
01:01:20,176 --> 01:01:22,720
<font color="white">and even asked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to help you make a living?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

608
01:01:22,804 --> 01:01:24,055
<font color="white">That's no way to speak of him.</font><font color="white"></font>

609
01:01:26,140 --> 01:01:27,433
<font color="white">I'm just upset.</font><font color="white"></font>

610
01:01:29,519 --> 01:01:30,978
<font color="white">Is he dead or alive?</font><font color="white"></font>

611
01:01:31,979 --> 01:01:33,815
<font color="white">If he's alive,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he could at least send word.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

612
01:01:37,443 --> 01:01:39,904
<font color="white">All right, enough. Off with you now.</font><font color="white"></font>

613
01:01:40,988 --> 01:01:41,823
<font color="white">I'm off.</font><font color="white"></font>

614
01:01:47,829 --> 01:01:50,915
<font color="white">Thank you for bringing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such fine paper every time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

615
01:01:51,499 --> 01:01:54,252
<font color="white">I picked out only the best of the best.</font><font color="white"></font>

616
01:01:54,961 --> 01:01:57,422
<font color="white">I'm glad you like them.</font><font color="white"></font>

617
01:01:58,339 --> 01:02:00,216
<font color="white">And how is the work?</font><font color="white"></font>

618
01:02:00,299 --> 01:02:01,592
<font color="white">It is not too hard, I hope?</font><font color="white"></font>

619
01:02:03,136 --> 01:02:05,304
<font color="white">Not at all.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm finally living a decent life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

620
01:02:06,180 --> 01:02:07,473
<font color="white">I just hope my lord…</font><font color="white"></font>

621
01:02:14,313 --> 01:02:16,941
<font color="white">If you'll excuse me,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'd best be on my way.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

622
01:02:29,287 --> 01:02:32,582
<font color="white">MUN-HEUL</font><font color="white"></font>

623
01:02:33,207 --> 01:02:34,459
<font color="white">I will deliver it,</font><font color="white"></font>

624
01:02:35,752 --> 01:02:37,712
<font color="white">but you never get a reply, so why…</font><font color="white"></font>

625
01:02:37,795 --> 01:02:38,838
<font color="white">I appreciate it.</font><font color="white"></font>

626
01:02:42,675 --> 01:02:45,553
<font color="white">I heard we have</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a new sister joining us today.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

627
01:02:45,636 --> 01:02:48,681
<font color="white">We've had quite a few new sisters</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">joining us lately.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

628
01:02:48,765 --> 01:02:49,849
<font color="white">That's good news.</font><font color="white"></font>

629
01:02:50,641 --> 01:02:52,143
<font color="white">She should be here by now.</font><font color="white"></font>

630
01:02:55,563 --> 01:02:56,731
<font color="white">There she is.</font><font color="white"></font>

631
01:03:04,739 --> 01:03:05,948
<font color="white">Oh, you can sit over there.</font><font color="white"></font>

632
01:03:07,241 --> 01:03:08,242
<font color="white">Welcome.</font><font color="white"></font>

633
01:03:08,326 --> 01:03:09,535
<font color="white">My apologies.</font><font color="white"></font>

634
01:03:09,619 --> 01:03:12,079
<font color="white">It's my first time,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and I seem to have arrived late.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

635
01:03:13,873 --> 01:03:16,459
<font color="white">Now that we are all gathered,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">let us begin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

636
01:03:18,628 --> 01:03:20,963
<font color="white">When one makes a vow before the Lord,</font><font color="white"></font>

637
01:03:21,464 --> 01:03:24,467
<font color="white">it must accord with</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what is right and true.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

638
01:03:26,677 --> 01:03:30,014
<font color="white">They need more candles</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for all the new sisters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

639
01:03:30,097 --> 01:03:33,392
<font color="white">-I see.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-…one dishonors and insults the Lord.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

640
01:03:33,976 --> 01:03:37,522
<font color="white">Therefore,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we must never forsake the truth.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

641
01:03:38,648 --> 01:03:40,066
<font color="white">Isn't that only natural?</font><font color="white"></font>

642
01:03:40,149 --> 01:03:42,568
<font color="white">It is no good living by lies.</font><font color="white"></font>

643
01:03:44,195 --> 01:03:45,112
<font color="white">Indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

644
01:03:45,613 --> 01:03:47,698
<font color="white">I'm right, aren't I?</font><font color="white"></font>

645
01:03:47,782 --> 01:03:48,658
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

646
01:03:49,659 --> 01:03:50,952
<font color="white">Let us continue.</font><font color="white"></font>

647
01:03:52,995 --> 01:03:56,249
<font color="white">Even if one does not invoke</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the holy name of the Lord,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

648
01:03:57,083 --> 01:04:01,420
<font color="white">the sin is the same as if one had.</font><font color="white"></font>

649
01:04:02,839 --> 01:04:05,925
<font color="white">Heaven and earth and all things</font><font color="white"></font>

650
01:04:06,759 --> 01:04:10,721
<font color="white">were created by the Lord for mankind…</font><font color="white"></font>

651
01:04:10,805 --> 01:04:12,890
<font color="white">What's wrong? Why did you not go in?</font><font color="white"></font>

652
01:04:14,016 --> 01:04:15,059
<font color="white">Are you leaving already?</font><font color="white"></font>

653
01:04:18,646 --> 01:04:20,565
<font color="white">I'm afraid I cannot stay today.</font><font color="white"></font>

654
01:04:22,358 --> 01:04:23,359
<font color="white">Please take these.</font><font color="white"></font>

655
01:04:23,442 --> 01:04:26,237
<font color="white">…and ever give thanks for His grace.</font><font color="white"></font>

656
01:04:27,488 --> 01:04:32,034
<font color="white">Therefore, Holy Mother Church</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has set apart one day in every seven,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

657
01:04:32,660 --> 01:04:34,078
<font color="white">calling it the Lord's Day…</font><font color="white"></font>

658
01:05:07,486 --> 01:05:09,697
<font color="white"><i>Time passes</i></font><font color="white"></font>

659
01:05:10,948 --> 01:05:13,034
<font color="white"><i>Flowers bloom</i></font><font color="white"></font>

660
01:05:15,202 --> 01:05:18,080
<font color="white"><i>Bees and butterflies</i></font><font color="white"></font>

661
01:05:18,164 --> 01:05:19,123
<font color="white">Oh, young master!</font><font color="white"></font>

662
01:05:19,206 --> 01:05:20,541
<font color="white"><i>Fly in</i></font><font color="white"></font>

663
01:05:20,625 --> 01:05:23,836
<font color="white"><i>Such is the order of nature</i></font><font color="white"></font>

664
01:05:23,920 --> 01:05:25,504
<font color="white"><i>Though nature's order</i></font><font color="white"></font>

665
01:05:26,297 --> 01:05:28,466
<font color="white"><i>Does not always follow what is right</i></font><font color="white"></font>

666
01:05:28,549 --> 01:05:32,511
<font color="white"><i>Wait, what nonsense is that?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Nature's order not being right?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

667
01:05:32,595 --> 01:05:36,182
<font color="white"><i>Plant soybeans, get soybeans</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Plant red beans, get red beans</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

668
01:05:36,682 --> 01:05:39,393
<font color="white"><i>Even a three-year-old knows</i></font><font color="white"></font>

669
01:05:39,477 --> 01:05:43,522
<font color="white"><i>That is the order of nature</i></font><font color="white"></font>

670
01:05:43,606 --> 01:05:47,777
<font color="white"><i>You might as well tell me</i></font><font color="white"></font>

671
01:05:47,860 --> 01:05:53,157
<font color="white"><i>That dignified Lady of the First Rank</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Started hurling her bolster about</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

672
01:05:53,240 --> 01:05:56,285
<font color="white"><i>Now that, I'd call nonsense</i></font><font color="white"></font>

673
01:05:56,369 --> 01:05:59,789
<font color="white"><i>Though this crying sounds rather serious</i></font><font color="white"></font>

674
01:06:01,040 --> 01:06:02,249
<font color="white"><i>Good heavens!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

675
01:06:02,333 --> 01:06:04,293
<font color="white"><i>-Well, would you look at that</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Mother…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

676
01:06:06,837 --> 01:06:09,048
<font color="white"><i>She still has plenty of fight left in her</i></font><font color="white"></font>

677
01:06:09,131 --> 01:06:12,635
<font color="white"><i>Even the Buddha himself</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Couldn't withstand such fury</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

678
01:06:12,718 --> 01:06:15,554
<font color="white"><i>Indeed, blessed are those who endure</i></font><font color="white"></font>

679
01:06:15,638 --> 01:06:18,224
<font color="white"><i>Tap-tap on the wooden fish</i></font><font color="white"></font>

680
01:06:18,307 --> 01:06:20,768
<font color="white"><i>A handsome little red bean from next door</i></font><font color="white"></font>

681
01:06:20,851 --> 01:06:23,145
<font color="white"><i>Fell into a soybean patch</i></font><font color="white"></font>

682
01:06:23,229 --> 01:06:25,481
<font color="white"><i>And got itself all tangled up in it</i></font><font color="white"></font>

683
01:06:25,564 --> 01:06:30,069
<font color="white"><i>Yet the noble folk of Bukchon</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Pretend not to notice</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

684
01:06:30,152 --> 01:06:33,489
<font color="white"><i>Drunk on wine, drunk on power</i></font><font color="white"></font>

685
01:06:33,572 --> 01:06:35,074
<font color="white"><i>They say</i></font><font color="white"></font>

686
01:06:35,157 --> 01:06:38,285
<font color="white"><i>"Isn't it a pleasure to study</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and practice what you have learned?"</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

687
01:06:38,369 --> 01:06:40,037
<font color="white">Where on earth is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

688
01:06:40,788 --> 01:06:42,873
<font color="white"><i>May as well lift a leg while you're at it</i></font><font color="white"></font>

689
01:06:42,957 --> 01:06:45,292
<font color="white"><i>What they are studying or practicing,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I couldn't say</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

690
01:06:45,376 --> 01:06:51,048
<font color="white"><i>But they certainly seem like</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>They are taking pleasure in it</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

691
01:06:51,841 --> 01:06:57,013
<font color="white"><i>The hawk moth that once fed on</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>The nectar of white gourd blossoms</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

692
01:06:57,096 --> 01:07:02,977
<font color="white"><i>Has done its part</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>And gone back to where it came from</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

693
01:07:03,060 --> 01:07:07,398
<font color="white"><i>Spring has come again</i></font><font color="white"></font>

694
01:07:07,481 --> 01:07:09,316
<font color="white"><i>But why won't it sprout?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

695
01:07:09,400 --> 01:07:11,861
<font color="white"><i>Black beans, chickpeas</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Cranberry beans, peas</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

696
01:07:11,944 --> 01:07:14,613
<font color="white"><i>Kidney beans, soybeans</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Beans, beans, beans</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

697
01:07:14,697 --> 01:07:16,782
<font color="white"><i>What kind of bean did they plant</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>That it won't sprout?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

698
01:07:16,866 --> 01:07:18,743
<font color="white"><i>Do you need to ask?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

699
01:07:18,826 --> 01:07:23,664
<font color="white"><i>An old dried-up bean</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>That's been sitting around for years</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

700
01:07:23,748 --> 01:07:26,584
<font color="white"><i>Rotten thorough</i></font><font color="white"></font>

701
01:07:26,667 --> 01:07:29,920
<font color="white"><i>And hollow inside</i></font><font color="white"></font>

702
01:07:30,004 --> 01:07:31,756
<font color="white"><i>But look, it did sprout</i></font><font color="white"></font>

703
01:07:31,839 --> 01:07:34,550
<font color="white"><i>So it wasn't supposed to sprout,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Yet it did?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

704
01:07:34,633 --> 01:07:36,927
<font color="white"><i>That means</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Everything worked out, does it not?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

705
01:07:37,011 --> 01:07:38,929
<font color="white"><i>Did you even watch from Episode 1?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

706
01:07:39,013 --> 01:07:43,559
<font color="white"><i>Stop talking nonsense</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>And go watch it again</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

707
01:07:43,642 --> 01:07:46,270
<font color="white"><i>The sprout came from the wrong bean</i></font><font color="white"></font>

708
01:07:46,353 --> 01:07:50,900
<font color="white"><i>Boy, if it came from the wrong bean</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Things have gone seriously wrong</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

709
01:07:50,983 --> 01:07:52,568
<font color="white"><i>-This is a matter of propriety</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-My lady!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

710
01:07:52,651 --> 01:07:55,029
<font color="white"><i>-If nature cannot be helped</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-This way!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

711
01:07:55,112 --> 01:07:56,864
<font color="white"><i>Then one should at least do what's right</i></font><font color="white"></font>

712
01:07:56,947 --> 01:08:00,910
<font color="white"><i>What's right, you say? Propriety?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

713
01:08:00,993 --> 01:08:02,369
<font color="white"><i>What about it?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

714
01:08:02,453 --> 01:08:04,830
<font color="white"><i>Can you not see? It's gone to the dogs</i></font><font color="white"></font>

715
01:08:05,873 --> 01:08:10,628
<font color="white"><i>Good grief, speak of the devil</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Certainly more devil than noble, that one</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

716
01:08:10,711 --> 01:08:14,381
<font color="white"><i>Honestly, has she no shame?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Look at her</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

717
01:08:14,465 --> 01:08:17,259
<font color="white"><i>Staring him right in the face</i></font><font color="white"></font>

718
01:08:17,343 --> 01:08:20,429
<font color="white"><i>Come now, they say a mother-in-law</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Always dotes on her son-in-law</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

719
01:08:20,513 --> 01:08:21,889
<font color="white"><i>Indeed</i></font><font color="white"></font>

720
01:08:21,972 --> 01:08:25,142
<font color="white"><i>Those cut from the same cloth</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Always close ranks</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

721
01:08:25,226 --> 01:08:28,437
<font color="white"><i>Blood runs thicker than water</i></font><font color="white"></font>

722
01:08:28,521 --> 01:08:31,690
<font color="white"><i>Like attracts like</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Thick as thieves</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

723
01:08:31,774 --> 01:08:33,859
<font color="white"><i>Birds of a feather do flock together</i></font><font color="white"></font>

724
01:08:34,985 --> 01:08:38,072
<font color="white"><i>"Noble," they call them</i></font><font color="white"></font>

725
01:08:38,155 --> 01:08:41,283
<font color="white"><i>More title than substance</i></font><font color="white"></font>

726
01:08:41,367 --> 01:08:44,370
<font color="white"><i>The sprout may not have come</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>From a soybean after all</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

727
01:08:44,453 --> 01:08:47,498
<font color="white"><i>But more likely a red bean</i></font><font color="white"></font>

728
01:08:47,581 --> 01:08:50,626
<font color="white"><i>Yet they sit there all prim and proper</i></font><font color="white"></font>

729
01:08:50,709 --> 01:08:54,588
<font color="white"><i>While raging inside</i></font><font color="white"></font>

730
01:08:54,672 --> 01:08:58,008
<font color="white"><i>They tried so hard to keep it quiet</i></font><font color="white"></font>

731
01:08:59,176 --> 01:09:02,847
<font color="white"><i>Yet whispers spread everywhere</i></font><font color="white"></font>

732
01:09:02,930 --> 01:09:06,725
<font color="white"><i>Murmur, murmur</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>This, that, and the other</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

733
01:09:06,809 --> 01:09:11,564
<font color="white"><i>Thanks to the wagging tongues</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Of the Bukchon ladies</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

734
01:09:11,647 --> 01:09:13,858
<font color="white"><i>Everyone who ought to know already knows</i></font><font color="white"></font>

735
01:09:13,941 --> 01:09:16,318
<font color="white"><i>Everyone except His Lordship, apparently</i></font><font color="white"></font>

736
01:09:16,402 --> 01:09:18,612
<font color="white"><i>Surely he does not know</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>No, he must not</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

737
01:09:18,696 --> 01:09:21,031
<font color="white"><i>If he did</i></font><font color="white"></font>

738
01:09:21,115 --> 01:09:25,244
<font color="white"><i>How could he act that way?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

739
01:09:26,203 --> 01:09:29,665
<font color="white"><i>Come now, after all this time?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

740
01:09:30,541 --> 01:09:32,960
<font color="white"><i>You still don't know the Bukchon nobles?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

741
01:09:33,043 --> 01:09:37,089
<font color="white"><i>They know perfectly well</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>And pretend otherwise</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

742
01:09:37,923 --> 01:09:41,886
<font color="white"><i>Well, well, with so many ladies</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>More talented than any clown</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

743
01:09:41,969 --> 01:09:44,305
<font color="white"><i>Gathered right here</i></font><font color="white"></font>

744
01:09:44,388 --> 01:09:47,349
<font color="white"><i>I'm so intimidated my voice is giving out</i></font><font color="white"></font>

745
01:09:47,892 --> 01:09:51,312
<font color="white"><i>I shall take my leave now</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>And head down to Namchon</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

746
01:09:52,021 --> 01:09:53,230
<font color="white"><i>Truth be told</i></font><font color="white"></font>

747
01:09:53,314 --> 01:09:56,400
<font color="white"><i>I'm scared out of my wits,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>So I'm making my escape</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

748
01:09:58,986 --> 01:10:01,155
<font color="white"><i>Run along, then</i></font><font color="white"></font>

749
01:10:45,574 --> 01:10:46,617
<font color="white">In this bitter cold…</font><font color="white"></font>

750
01:10:48,994 --> 01:10:51,538
<font color="white">you have come all this way again?</font><font color="white"></font>

751
01:10:52,248 --> 01:10:55,000
<font color="white">The fact that someone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is still sending him letters…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

752
01:10:58,921 --> 01:11:00,714
<font color="white">means I am not the only one</font><font color="white"></font>

753
01:11:02,007 --> 01:11:04,426
<font color="white">who believes he is still alive,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">does it not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

754
01:11:04,510 --> 01:11:06,512
<font color="white">I have spent all my years</font><font color="white"></font>

755
01:11:08,055 --> 01:11:10,140
<font color="white">at the young master's side.</font><font color="white"></font>

756
01:11:11,934 --> 01:11:12,810
<font color="white">And so</font><font color="white"></font>

757
01:11:13,560 --> 01:11:16,855
<font color="white">if I may presume to read his heart,</font><font color="white"></font>

758
01:11:22,778 --> 01:11:25,030
<font color="white">he would have me bring you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a warm cup of tea.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

759
01:11:28,742 --> 01:11:30,119
<font color="white">I believe he would.</font><font color="white"></font>

760
01:11:33,831 --> 01:11:35,040
<font color="white">Do go inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

761
01:11:55,477 --> 01:11:56,395
<font color="white">Yun!</font><font color="white"></font>

762
01:12:01,317 --> 01:12:02,484
<font color="white">Yun!</font><font color="white"></font>

763
01:12:08,324 --> 01:12:09,658
<font color="white">Yun!</font><font color="white"></font>

764
01:12:42,941 --> 01:12:45,152
<font color="white"><i>I am well.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

765
01:12:46,612 --> 01:12:47,780
<font color="white"><i>I live</i></font><font color="white"></font>

766
01:12:48,989 --> 01:12:50,532
<font color="white"><i>much as I always have.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

767
01:12:52,076 --> 01:12:52,993
<font color="white"><i>Yet,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

768
01:12:53,911 --> 01:12:56,372
<font color="white"><i>more and more often,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

769
01:12:57,164 --> 01:12:59,458
<font color="white"><i>I find myself wondering</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>whether you are truly gone.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

770
01:13:02,419 --> 01:13:03,379
<font color="white"><i>And whenever I do,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

771
01:13:04,922 --> 01:13:06,423
<font color="white"><i>the same thought comes to me.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

772
01:13:08,884 --> 01:13:12,638
<font color="white"><i>Had I followed you</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and left everything behind,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

773
01:13:14,306 --> 01:13:15,182
<font color="white"><i>I would not</i></font><font color="white"></font>

774
01:13:16,433 --> 01:13:19,019
<font color="white"><i>have been left with nothing but longing.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

775
01:13:23,690 --> 01:13:24,650
<font color="white"><i>Dear cousin.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

776
01:13:25,401 --> 01:13:26,944
<font color="white"><i>If by some chance…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

777
01:13:28,987 --> 01:13:30,114
<font color="white"><i>you are</i></font><font color="white"></font>

778
01:13:31,073 --> 01:13:33,283
<font color="white"><i>alive somewhere, living as though dead,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

779
01:13:34,827 --> 01:13:37,579
<font color="white"><i>would you please come back to me?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

780
01:13:39,123 --> 01:13:40,165
<font color="white"><i>I remain here,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

781
01:13:41,125 --> 01:13:42,209
<font color="white"><i>living as though alive,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

782
01:13:43,585 --> 01:13:45,462
<font color="white"><i>while dying inside.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

783
01:17:49,164 --> 01:17:54,169
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

